From 115cf9888429742504c1bda73e03d8eb97844385 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Media Makers <contato@mediamakers.com.br>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 08:08:48 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(send): set Width/Height on image messages so clients
 keep the aspect ratio

ImageMessage was sent without Width/Height. WhatsApp clients size the chat
bubble from these fields before the media is downloaded; without them the iOS
app falls back to a square bubble and center-crops every portrait or landscape
image (a 1080x1350 image loses ~10% at the top and bottom).

Read the pixel size with image.DecodeConfig (no full decode) and set it on every
ImageMessage built from an uploaded file: /send/media (file and URL, regular and
newsletter), carousel image headers and image status. When the size cannot be
read the fields stay nil and the message is sent as before.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
